        "notes": "A custody-and-succession instrument in the current Line Set declaration; its colorless Main reader holds the native instruments apart, and Witness remains outside LINE_SET. Copper records allocation arithmetic; Iron records scenario-bound recovery comparisons; neither replaces Silver custody declarations. Source availability is access-dependent. Previously verified source archive: 0.4.0, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24069439; identifies that source ZIP only, not a standalone manuscript. DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22833486 remains an earlier historical archive reference. This metadata cites later source through its repository until that exact edition/object is independently verified. Any GitHub Release and existing public Zenodo hook use require actual owner authority; verify resulting archives under docs/publication.md without guessing identifiers or amending immutable tags."
